    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/seo-consultant/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The SEO Consultant Theme is a professional platform tailored for SEO and marketing experts, including those at SEO companies, digital marketing agencies, and web design agencies, all aimed at enhancing growth and visibility online. Designed for SEO specialists, digital marketing teams, content creators, and local service providers, it showcases advanced strategies and measurable results. This theme emphasizes essential services such as keyword research, SEO audits, backlink analysis, on-page and off-page optimization, and technical SEO solutions, all presented in a clean and structured layout. It enables startup businesses to communicate their marketing strategies, organic growth plans, and performance reports with clarity and impact. With modern design elements and flexible customization options, it fosters strong brand presentation and user engagement. The responsive layouts ensure compatibility with all devices, while its SEO-focused structure aids in lead generation and building trust. Ideal for any social media marketing agency or business consulting firm offering SEO and marketing services, it enhances online presence and potential client conversion."
    },
